@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+## Why
+
+Three order-service behaviours contradict the README business rules: lower-case SKUs are refused, goods of exactly €50.00 are charged shipping, and line VAT is rounded down instead of half up.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- SKU lookup is case-insensitive and ignores surrounding spaces, as documented.
+- Shipping is free when goods (after every discount, before VAT) are €50.00 or more, not only above it.
+- Line VAT is rounded half up to the cent (€1.99 at 22% gives €0.44, not €0.43).
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `product-catalog`: SKU identity and lookup.
+- `shipping`: shipping cost and the free-shipping threshold.
+- `vat`: VAT computation and rounding.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/catalog.ts`, `src/shipping.ts`, `src/tax.ts`, plus tests. Invoices and receipts change only where VAT or shipping amounts change.
